      <activity id="af966371-4a95-5c94-84f9-d78c7c5cf3c5" activityNameId="208cf4c1-0f94-5b52-9f67-dc32176a8cd7" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Disposal of heating system, office building Verenastrasse</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Disposal of heating system, office building Verenastrasse
Disposal of components for the heating system;
UUID: 6d75dbc2-c309-4e9d-a512-86146ae91b17
Transport to dismantling facilities, machines for handling in sorting plant, electricity demand for sorting plant, final disposal of waste material. Cut-off to recycling for metals.
Location: Specific to the technology mix encountered in sorting plants in Switzerland.
Technology: Disposal to a sorting plant assumed. Metal pieces, copper in cables and electronic devices are recycled, plastic parts are incinerated, inert wastes are landfilled.
Time period: Amount of material investigated in 2013. Disposal technology mix as used in late 1990ies
Production volume: na
Sampling: Waste-specific calculation based on input data from call of bids for a heating system of a specific building. 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_6d75dbc2-c309-4e9d-a512-86146ae91b17.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
